AiTask qa_v41_r3_conversations {
  label: 'Weekly AI Conversation Review'
  description: 'Reviews the past week of AI conversations and emails the insights and common questions.'
  brief: @md
    ## At a glance
    - Source: All AI conversations in the workspace
    - Sends to: Email · nhi.ty@holistics.io
    - Condition: none, every run
    - Attachment: None
    - Schedule: Fridays 9:00 AM UTC (cron 0 9 * * 5)

    ## Definitions
    - The review covers the last 7 days.
    - Do not include personal details of the people asking.

    ## Steps
    1. Read the AI conversations from the last 7 days.
    2. Find the recurring questions, the main insights and anything left unanswered.
    3. Write the result with `write_ai_task_result`.
    4. Email it to nhi.ty@holistics.io.
  ;;
  acceptance_criteria: @md
    Summarizes the main insights and the most common questions from the last 7 days.
    Includes no personal details.
  ;;
}
